A23  the saddle dip in the framework's own law, WITH the external-field effect
Premise: g_N=g^2/(g+a0) is exactly AQUAL mu=x/(1+x) (A24).  AQUAL HAS an EFE.
The no-EFE premise of the original tasking is refuted by A24 and is NOT used here.
